1. An electroluminescence display device comprising:

a substrate;

a plurality of recessed portions formed over the substrate;

a plurality of transparent electrodes respectively disposed in the plurality of recessed portions;

an organic light-emitting layer disposed over the plurality of transparent electrodes;

a plurality of active elements electrically connected to respective ones of the plurality of transparent electrodes; and

a reflective layer disposed over at least a portion of each of the plurality of transparent electrodes,

wherein the reflective layer is configured to reflect light emitted from the organic light-emitting layer toward a display side of the electroluminescence display device, and

wherein the reflective layer includes contact portions electrically connecting the respective transparent electrodes to the respective active elements.
